{"overview":{"Symbol":"SGP","Name":"SpyGlass Pharma, Inc.","Description":"SpyGlass Pharma, Inc. operates as a biopharmaceutical company that provides treatment and drug delivery for patients living with chronic eye conditions. The company develops the Bimatoprost Drug Pad-IOL System (BIM-IOL System), including novel and proprietary drug pads attached to an intraocular lens (IOL), which is designed to be implanted during routine cataract surgery to reduce elevated intraocular pressure (IOP) in patients. It also develops a non-IOL-based, ring-shaped, sustained-release implant with bimatoprost. SpyGlass Pharma, Inc. was formerly known as SpyGlass Ophthalmics, Inc. and changed its name to SpyGlass Pharma, Inc. in April 2021. The company was incorporated in 2019 and is based in Aliso Viejo, California.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Healthcare","Industry":"Biotechnology","Address":"27061 Aliso Creek Road, Aliso Viejo, CA, 92656, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"606481088","EBITDA":"-40837000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"7.481","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-1.34","RevenuePerShareTTM":"","ProfitMargin":"0","OperatingMarginTTM":"0","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.37225","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-0.67705","RevenueTTM":"","GrossProfitTTM":"","DilutedEPSTTM":"-1.34","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"","AnalystTargetPrice":"45","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"-6.725817","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"","PriceToBookRatio":"2.4248095","EVToRevenue":"","EVToEBITDA":"-17.126","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"32.44","52WeekLow":"17.6","50DayMovingAverage":"22.37","200DayMovingAverage":"24.279768","SharesOutstanding":"33433355","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"1.497"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"SGP","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-06-11","4. Output Size":"Comp